Fixes:
- Count time on a clock of 30 frames a second, the rate it was made for, so a 60 fps project plays it at the same speed.
- Take the three glitch colours and how they blend as props, so the glitch can be coloured and shows on dark backgrounds.
- Take the font as a prop, following the project's main font by default.

